From c8f75ab0694a3bfce7349e4dd7dd6c6d7d231f52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: armSeb <armSeb@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:30:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: add LG G3 LGD SIC 1440p dual DSI video panel

Panel driver for the 1440x2560 LGD "SIC" video mode panel of the LG G3
(D855), driven over two DSI links (720x2560 each, 4 lanes). Init and off
sequences, timings and power-up order come from the vendor device tree
(msm8974pro-lge-panel.dtsi). Supplies: vdd (1.8 V), vsp/vsn (TPS65132).

Signed-off-by: armSeb <armSeb@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../gpu/drm/panel/msm8974-generated/Kconfig   |   8 +
 .../gpu/drm/panel/msm8974-generated/Makefile  |   1 +
 .../msm8974-generated/panel-lge-g3-lgd-sic.c  | 369 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 378 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/msm8974-generated/panel-lge-g3-lgd-sic.c

